{"id":"8e5ba7b1bb23682fbb77c88cac17ec27206f32df","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1259871","title":"agy 提示账号不支持使用的曲线救国方案","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"mouseman","excerpt":"Google Gemini - @mouseman - 假如你是港区或国区谷歌账号，不小心开通了订阅。 想用 agy 提示账号不支持，申请换区还困难，有一个曲线救国的方案。 节点换成支持的地区，将另一个其他受 agy 支持地区的账号拉入家庭。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>假如你是港区或国区谷歌账号，不小心开通了订阅。<br>\n想用 agy 提示账号不支持，申请换区还困难，有一个曲线救国的方案。<br>\n节点换成支持的地区，将另一个其他受 agy 支持地区的账号拉入家庭。<br>\nagy 额度都是共享的，以后就用小号使用 agy 就行了。</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n<div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/账号\"><li></li> 账号</a><a href=\"/tag/方案\"><li></li> 方案</a><a href=\"/tag/家庭\"><li></li> 家庭</a></P><p><span>15 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-26 15:39:47 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328081\" data-reply-id=\"18328081\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8551/d9b2/235976_normal.png?m=1793763918\" alt=\"aimuz\" data-uid=\"235976\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>1</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>跨地区不支持加入家庭组</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328176\" data-reply-id=\"18328176\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0333/c41a/361493_normal.png?m=1794806074\" alt=\"Saiwenee\" data-uid=\"361493\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>4</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>我把 google 服务的所有域名和 ip 全都单独分流到了美区 然后去 <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/country-association-form\" rel=\"nofollow\">申请换区</a> 到美区 选的理由是 <code>I frequently use a Virtual Private Network (VPN)</code> 两个账号都是一次性通过申请</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328186\" data-reply-id=\"18328186\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d97f9da872c3fe84d087943a61e1bbd1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"suzuki46\" data-uid=\"28908\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>5</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>没必要账号一定要在一个区。主要就是看支付的资料 把之前的删除，新建一个跟主账号一个地区的支付资料，就能成功接受邀请</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328401\" data-reply-id=\"18328401\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9717/e3b5/73388_normal.png?m=1778212727\" alt=\"miyuki\" data-uid=\"73388\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>6</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>It looks like you're not in the same country as the person who invited you.</p>\n<p>只留了日本的 Payment Profile，挂了日本的梯子还是不行</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328438\" data-reply-id=\"18328438\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9717/e3b5/73388_normal.png?m=1778212727\" alt=\"miyuki\" data-uid=\"73388\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>7</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>昨天开了港区的 pro，如果换日区有坑吗</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328457\" data-reply-id=\"18328457\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e0cc/29fb/640863_normal.png?m=1789395560\" alt=\"Mercury333\" data-uid=\"640863\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>8</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>我就是这样操作的，顺便把主账号换区也成功了</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328606\" data-reply-id=\"18328606\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ce69/fe24/290250_normal.png?m=1780045585\" alt=\"Allenbayern\" data-uid=\"290250\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>9</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>google pay 设置改支付方式，想改哪个地区添加哪个地区的，可以是假的，用地址生成器</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328830\" data-reply-id=\"18328830\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2904/7d7d/582348_normal.png?m=1748504239\" alt=\"kerwin1874\" data-uid=\"582348\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>10</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>帐号区域是美国，还是用不了，估计是因为梯子是 ams 主机自建的，ip 机房特征太明显了。</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328907\" data-reply-id=\"18328907\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/84041ad77977dba2f460da9e512cc483?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Wh1t3zZ\" data-uid=\"462787\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>11</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>申请换区很困难吗，我和同事几个帐号提交申请换到美国很快就通过了</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18329219\" data-reply-id=\"18329219\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3363/4c80/121671_normal.png?m=1773662128\" alt=\"lc4t\" data-uid=\"121671\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n 